Table full name: WEATHER__ENVIRONMENT.CYBERSYN.FEMA_DISASTER_DECLARATION_INDEX
Column name: DISASTER_END_DATE Type: DATE Description: Date the disaster itself ended.
Column name: STATE_OBLIGATED_PUBLIC_ASSISTANCE_CATEGORY_C_TO_G_AMOUNT Type: FLOAT Description: The Public Assistance grant funding available in dollars to the grantee (State), for sub-grantee approved Project Worksheets in categories C through G, or Permanent Work. Category C is Roads and bridges; Category D is Water control facilities; Category E is Public buildings and contents; Category F is Public utilities; Category G is Parks, recreational, and other facilities.
Column name: DISASTER_DECLARATION_TYPE Type: TEXT Description: Identifies the disaster declaration as major disaster, fire management, or emergency declaration.
Column name: DECLARED_PROGRAMS Type: ARRAY Description: Major programs declared for all geographies impacted by the disaster.
Column name: APPROVED_INDIVIDUAL_AND_HOUSEHOLDS_PROGRAM_AMOUNT Type: FLOAT Description: The total amount approved for the Individual and Households Program (IHP) in dollars.
Column name: INDIVIDUAL_ASSISTANCE_UPDATE_DATE Type: DATE Description: The date the Individual Assistance (IA) data was updated by NEMIS.
Column name: STATE_OBLIGATED_PUBLIC_ASSISTANCE_CATEGORY_A_B_AMOUNT Type: FLOAT Description: The Public Assistance grant funding available in dollars to the grantee (State), for sub-grantee approved Project Worksheets in categories A and B, or Emergency Work. Category A is Debris removal; Category B is Emergency protective measures.
Column name: DISASTER_DECLARATION_REQUEST_ID Type: TEXT Description: Number assigned to the declaration request.
Column name: DISASTER_ID Type: TEXT Description: Sequentially FEMA-assigned number used to designate an event or incident declared as a disaster.
Column name: DISASTER_BEGIN_DATE Type: DATE Description: Date the disaster itself began.
Column name: APPROVED_INDIVIDUAL_ASSISTANCE_APPLICATIONS Type: NUMBER Description: The number of disaster assistance applications that were approved for Individual Assistance (IA).
Column name: DISASTER_TYPE Type: TEXT Description: Type of disaster such as fire or flood.
Column name: STATE_OBLIGATED_HAZARD_MITIGATION_GRANT_PROGRAM_AMOUNT Type: FLOAT Description: Total amount obligated under the Hazard Mitigation Grant Program in dollars. The total amount obligated represents the amount obligated for Regular Project Costs, Planning Costs, Initiative Project Costs, Recipient Management Costs, Recipient Admin Costs and Subrecipient Admin Costs.
Column name: STATE_OBLIGATED_PUBLIC_ASSISTANCE_AMOUNT Type: FLOAT Description: The Public Assistance grant funding available in dollars to the grantee (State), for sub-grantee approved Project Worksheets.
Column name: DISASTER_DECLARATION_DATE Type: DATE Description: Date the disaster was declared.
Column name: PUBLIC_ASSISTANCE_UPDATE_DATE Type: DATE Description: The date the Public Assistance (PA) data was updated by NEMIS.
Column name: DISASTER_DECLARATION_NAME Type: TEXT Description: Title for the disaster.
