Column name: REQUESTED_ASSISTANCE_DESCRIPTION Type: TEXT Description: Additional information about the assistance request.
Column name: CITY Type: TEXT Description: Place of performance if available.
Column name: STATE_COST_SHARE_PERCENT Type: FLOAT Description: Percentage of the cost for which the state or tribal government is responsible.
Column name: STATE_GEO_ID Type: TEXT Description: Cybersyn's unique identifier for a state, joinable to GEOGRAPHY_INDEX.
Column name: OBLIGATION_AMOUNT Type: FLOAT Description: Total dollars amount obligated.
Column name: FEMA_RECORD_ID Type: TEXT Description: Unique record identifier from FEMA for the mission assignment.
Column name: STATE_COST_SHARE_AMOUNT Type: FLOAT Description: Dollar amount of the cost for which the state or tribal government is responsible.
Column name: ZIP_GEO_ID Type: TEXT Description: Cybersyn's unique identifier for a zip code, joinable to GEOGRAPHY_INDEX.
Column name: PROJECTED_COMPLETION_DATE Type: DATE Description: Estimated end of the mission. Subject to revision.
Column name: REQUESTED_DATE Type: DATE Description: Date a State or Tribe requested assistance.
Column name: REQUESTED_AMOUNT Type: FLOAT Description: Total cost in dollars, as requested by state or tribal government.
Column name: FEDERAL_COST_SHARE_PERCENT Type: FLOAT Description: Percentage of the cost for which FEMA is responsible.
Column name: OBLIGATION_DATE Type: DATE Description: Date the Mission Assignment was obligated.
Column name: STATEMENT_OF_WORK Type: TEXT Description: Description of the requested assistance.
Column name: MISSION_ASSIGNMENT_ID Type: TEXT Description: Identifier for request, used to aggregate funding across multiple days.
Column name: FEDERAL_COST_SHARE_AMOUNT Type: FLOAT Description: Dollar amount of the cost for which FEMA is responsible.
Column name: DISASTER_ID Type: TEXT Description: Sequentially FEMA-assigned number used to designate an event or incident declared as a disaster.
Column name: AMENDMENT_ID Type: NUMBER Description: Obligation requests may be modified to adjust or add funds. This number identifies those amendments. The value is 0 if there are no amendments.
Column name: REQUESTING_AGENCY Type: TEXT Description: Name of the entity requesting assistance.
Sample rows:
