Column name: VARIABLE_NAME Type: TEXT Description: Human-readable unique name for the variable.
Column name: EMISSION_TYPE Type: TEXT Description: Categorization of emissions based on their nature (e.g. CO2 - carbon dioxide).
Column name: SCENARIO Type: TEXT Description: A projected pathway of future emissions based on certain assumptions about economic, technological, demographic, policy, and behavioral factors.
Column name: SECTOR Type: TEXT Description: Relate to the division of emission sources into broad segments of human activity.
Column name: FREQUENCY Type: TEXT Description: Frequency of aggregations.
Column name: UNIT Type: TEXT Description: Unit of measurement for the reported value.
Column name: SOURCE Type: TEXT Description: Climate Watch aggregates climate data from multiple sources. Source of the data as reported by Climate Watch.
Column name: VARIABLE Type: TEXT Description: Unique identifier for a variable, joinable to the timeseries table.
Column name: MEASURE Type: TEXT Description: Quantifiable attribute or subject; description of what is being recorded.
