Table full name: WEATHER__ENVIRONMENT.CYBERSYN.FEMA_REGION_INDEX
Column name: FEMA_REGION_ID Type: TEXT Description: The FEMA Region number.
Column name: LATITUDE Type: FLOAT Description: Latitude of the FEMA Region Headquarters.
Column name: LONGITUDE Type: FLOAT Description: Longitude of the FEMA Region Headquarters.
